From: Daniel Casota <dcasota@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] 10202/10204 (7.x): match_canister_structs fixes - iterator bound, opaque declarations, shared-node frees, struct equality, cache sizing/publication, bitfields, anonymous-aggregate arrays, .c-local structures; pad list trimmed to the 7.x canister

Linux 7.3-rc4 port of the Photon FIPS canister series.
See EXPERIMENTAL-7.3-rc4-FIPS.md for the per-patch decisions.
---
